{
  "company_name": "CompliFlow Systems",
  "industry": "Oil & Gas Midstream",
  "use_case": "Regulatory compliance monitoring and audit management for midstream operations",
  "space_title": "CompliFlow Systems - Regulation & Compliance 📋",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Oil & Gas Midstream\n\n**Use case:** Regulatory Compliance Monitoring & Audit Management\n\nCompliFlow Systems — regulatory compliance analytics across PHMSA, EPA, FERC, and state-level pipeline safety regulations. EH&S directors and Chief Compliance Officers use this space to track open findings, fine exposure, and audit closure rates; operations and legal teams use it to prioritize remediation and avoid escalations to enforcement.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Compliance score (0-100) — composite audit and findings score (target >90)\n- Open findings — backlog of unresolved audit items\n- Overdue actions — past-due remediation items (target = 0)\n- Total fines ($) — enforcement exposure by regulatory body\n- Avg resolution days — speed of closing violations (target <30 days)\n- Violation count — Notices of Probable Violation issued\n- Closure rate (%) — % of findings closed on time\n- Training completion (%) — workforce compliance readiness\n\n**Data sources**\n- `compliance_events` — individual violations, NOPVs, audits with fines and severity\n- `audit_snapshots` — periodic compliance score, open findings, overdue actions\n- `compliance_kpi_monthly` — monthly rollup of violations, fines, closure rate",
